    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>20 unique designs: Midnight Dark, Cloud Light, Classic Bebas, Neon Glow, Flip Cards, Minimal Air, Gradient Ring, Retro LED, Outline Max, Aurora Glass, Sunset Glow, Typewriter Paper, Ocean Depth, Golden Royal, Hacker Terminal, Candy Pop, Arctic Frost, Wine Classic, Forest Pine, Rainbow Flow. Use <code>[dgc_shortcode]</code>, <code>[dgc_shortcode style=\"c20\"]</code>, Gutenberg &#8220;Digital Clock&#8221; block, or Appearance <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Widgets. Vanilla JS — fast, no moment.js/jQuery needed.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the folder to <code>wp-content/plugins</code>, activate from Plugins page.</li>\n<li>Go to Dashboard <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Digital Clock, pick a design, Save.</li>\n<li>Place via shortcode, block, Elementor Shortcode widget, or Widgets.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>11 new clocks (total 20): Aurora Glass, Sunset Glow, Typewriter Paper, Ocean Depth, Golden Royal, Hacker Terminal, Candy Pop, Arctic Frost, Wine Classic, Forest Pine, Rainbow Flow.</li>\n<li>Old 9 clocks untouched. Shortcode override range now c1–c20.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>New clock c9 &#8220;Outline Max&#8221; — screenshot look: big hollow outline digits, dim weekday row, PM label.</li>\n<li>Fixed c1/c2 digits wrapping to two lines in narrow sidebars (nowrap + compact size).</li>\n<li>Shortcode override range now c1–c9.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>5 new clocks: Neon Glow, Flip Cards, Minimal Air, Gradient Ring, Retro LED.</li>\n<li>WP 6.8 support, Requires PHP 7.4, vanilla JS (removed moment.js/jQuery dep).</li>\n<li>New Digital Clock Studio admin UI with visual cards + live preview.</li>\n<li>Added Gutenberg block + style=&#8221;c1..c8&#8243; shortcode attribute.</li>\n<li>Full code modernized, escaping/sanitization hardened.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Previous stable.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Add 20 beautiful live clocks — widget, shortcode &amp; Gutenberg block with auto timezone.",
    "description": "<p>20 unique designs: Midnight Dark, Cloud Light, Classic Bebas, Neon Glow, Flip Cards, Minimal Air, Gradient Ring, Retro LED, Outline Max, Aurora Glass, Sunset Glow, Typewriter Paper, Ocean Depth, Golden Royal, Hacker Terminal, Candy Pop, Arctic Frost, Wine Classic, Forest Pine, Rainbow Flow. Use <code>[dgc_shortcode]</code>, <code>[dgc_shortcode style=\"c20\"]</code>, Gutenberg &#8220;Digital Clock&#8221; block, or Appearance <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Widgets. Vanilla JS — fast, no moment.js/jQuery needed.</p>\n",
